>\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:75.9%; left:48%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:43.7%; left:53%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:6px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:78.6%; left:27.1%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstad</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:52.9%; left:63.4%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"IFK Norrköping\">Norrköping</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:1.4%; left:75.8%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:6px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">Sundsvall</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:42.6%; left:84.4%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Fotboll\">Djurgården</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Placering av deltagande lag, allsvenskan 1991.</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Fotbollsallsvenskan 1991</b> spelades <a href=\"/wiki/7_april\" title=\"7 april\">7 april</a>–<a href=\"/wiki/11_augusti\" title=\"11 augusti\">11 augusti</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sport%C3%A5ret_1991\" title=\"Sportåret 1991\">1991</a> och vanns av <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Svenska_Fotbollf%C3%B6rbundet\" title=\"Svenska Fotbollförbundet\">Svenska Fotbollförbundet</a> påbörjade försök med nya seriesystem. Serien var inför denna säsong nedbantat från 12 lag till 10 lag inför den här säsongen, och lag 1–6 gick till mästerskapsserien, där alla mötte alla och segraren blev svensk mästare. Mästerskapsserien ersatte från denna säsong SM-slutspelet. Lag 7–10 i grundserien fick spela Kvalsvenskan med lag från andradivisionen. <a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A4sterskapsserien\" title=\"Mästerskapsserien\">Mästerskapsserien</a> spelades <a href=\"/wiki/25_augusti\" title=\"25 augusti\">25 augusti</a>–<a href=\"/wiki/27_oktober\" title=\"27 oktober\">27 oktober</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sport%C3%A5ret_1991\" title=\"Sportåret 1991\">1991</a>, och vanns av <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tabeller\">Tabeller</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1991&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Tabeller\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1991&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Tabeller\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable infobox\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#bbffbb\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Mästerskapsserien_1991\">Mästerskapsserien 1991</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#f4dcdc\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Kvalsvenskan_1991\">Kvalsvenskan 1991</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Poängtabell\"><span id=\"Po.C3.A4ngtabell\"></span>Poängtabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1991&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Poängtabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1991&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Poängtabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_1991\" title=\"Mall:Poängtabell för Fotbollsallsvenskan 1991\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_1991&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_1991&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\";\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">redigera</span></a></span>&#160;\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"font-size:0.9375em;line-height:1.4em;text-align:center;background:white;margin-top:0.1em;\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"width:1.8em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Placering\">Nr</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 13em;\"> Lag </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Spelade matcher\">S</span></th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Vinster\">V</span>        </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Oavgjorda\">O</span>      </